{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/983277-2e-mechanics-as-conditions","id":983277,"title":"[2E] Mechanics as Conditions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-07T06:22:45-07:00","id":983277,"title":"[2E] Mechanics as Conditions","content":"In going more deep into 2E mechanics/storytelling relation, I want to connect some diverse smaller mechanics as proper Conditions for characters, especially to let players get Beats for \u2018playing them\u2019. One of this things is <i>Disease</i> Condition, based obviously on Disease rules. I suspect probably are more thing like that could work with Conditions system \u2013 I think also on <i>\u2018Crisis of Faith\u2019 </i>Condition for doubting priest I want to put in to game \u2013 this would probably limit somehow Willpower of character. Have any other ideas or Conditions propositions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T07:54:27-07:00","id":983321,"title":"","content":"I think more specific examples are needed as a starting point.<br /> <br /> Trawling in my brain for <i>anything</i> that isn't already represented, what about a Healing Condition?<br /> <br /> <b>Healing</b><br /> Even the toughest body needs time to heal. Whenever you are not immediately under stress, your body can begin to recover. Depending on the type of wound, and your healing capabilities, this Condition remains around for anything from a few minutes (for accelerated healing of Bashing Damage), to two weeks (for unmodified healing of Aggravated Damage). When its time is up, the Condition lapses (instead of Resolving) and the damage is healed.<br /> <b>Resolution:</b> Taking additional damage or doing something strenuous enough to interrupt and reset healing.<br /> <br /> Idea here is that the Condition covers the time the character spends healing. Normally, it will just expire and heal the damage without granting a Beat (so, as healing works now). However, the Resolution will reward someone slowing down their recovery to do some necessary thing right now (like getting out of the hospital bed they are recovering in to go investigate a mystery).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T20:13:17-07:00","id":983715,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a>, great idea, I will surely use it for longer healing in my games. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Here is my bait on Disease mechanics:<br /> <br /> <b>Sick ( Disease, Severity)</b><br /> Character is sick with Disease. She can function, but illness takes its toll on him. If he do not take his meds, he is treated as having penalty to all rolls equal to Disease Severity. Each day he also roll Stamina + Resolve modified by Severity and taking medicines or treatment. If not, character takes 2*Severity of Bashing damage. If it will be above of her Health, she lose conscious and is in healing coma.<br /> <b>Possible Sources:</b> Lower biological protection. Witches curse.<br /> <b>Resolution:</b> Making Severity number of successful rolls for treatable disease. Remission for life long ones.<br /> <b>Beat: </b>Character takes her meds to negate penalty for this day.<br /> <br /> <b>Examples Disease Severities:</b><br /> Common Cold \u2013 1<br /> Flu \u2013 2<br /> Heart Condition \u2013 4<br /> Cancer or HIV - 5","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-07-2016, 11:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}